<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύ̆-πορος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quick-going,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always epith. of ships, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				488
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Choeril.
				6
			</span></i>; of streams, <i>swift-flowing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρθμευμ᾽ ἀχέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1557
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυμάτων ῥιπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.194
				</span></i>
			: later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀϊστοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.85
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Claudian.
			</span></i>); of a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύπορος μετανίσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
					1 iii 37
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
